mall, robust, agile and affordable means of transport, capable of relaunching mobility, giving impetus to the recovery of the country’s economic and civil life. To make this dream come true, Piaggio turns to engineer Corradino D’Ascanio, a brilliant designer who uses the experience gained in the field of aeronautics to create the scooter that remains today the symbol of Italian creativity and design: the Vespa!"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7hjasPkxfhQYNPTWqUb0hCMh8aX.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oUluRpH0CxIX3UVrPGfnNEq2Do7.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":647579,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7hjasPkxfhQYNPTWqUb0hCMh8aX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7hjasPkxfhQYNPTWqUb0hCMh8aX.jpg","language":"it","width":1169,"height":1753},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7hjasPkxfhQYNPTWqUb0hCMh8aX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7hjasPkxfhQYNPTWqUb0hCMh8aX.jpg","language":"it","width":1169,"height":1753},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jsY42Pusy2YLxBg5lvFlJQbWuBi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jsY42Pusy2YLxBg5lvFlJQbWuBi.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kyelSe1ibPaXwN2mMqYyA891Ud.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kyelSe1ibPaXwN2mMqYyA891Ud.jpg","language":"it","width":1241,"height":1754},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a3DwEQLy9p7ORnnNSYkRf4J8w2W.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a3DwEQLy9p7ORnnNSYkRf4J8w2W.jpg","language":"it","width":844,"height":1266}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tm